The integration follows the public BMW CarData documentation (Integration
Guide 1.6 of 30/07/2026, customer API and device code flow swagger files). The
practical details of the stream (TLS 1.3, one connection per account, value
shapes) were learnt from the Home Assistant integrations kvanbiesen/bmw-cardata-ha
(BSD 2-Clause) and JustChr/BavarianData (MIT); no file of them is included.
test/fixtures/catalogue-descriptors.json lists the technical descriptor names
of BMW's Telematics Data Catalogue, as exported by JustChr/BavarianData.

